{
  "_comment": "本清单是文本前缀规则,不完备,不是安全边界:git push 的等价写法(如 git push origin HEAD:main、+refspec 强推、git -C <目录> push ...、--force-with-lease)绕得过;Read 规则只覆盖 cwd 内的直接读。另注意:权限按 deny → ask → allow 评估,deny 优先,宽 deny 压得住窄规则豁免——所以模板类文件名用『枚举危险形态』天然避开,不加白名单。见 SKILL.md『已知限制』第 1、2 条。",
  "permissions": {
    "deny": [
      "Bash(sudo:*)",
      "Bash(mkfs:*)",
      "Bash(dd:*)",
      "Bash(shred:*)",
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(git push -f:*)",
      "Bash(git push --force-with-lease:*)",
      "Bash(git push -f :*)",
      "Bash(git push origin main:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin master:*)",
      "Read(./**/.env)",
      "Read(./**/.env.local)",
      "Read(./**/.env.production)",
      "Read(./**/.env.development)",
      "Read(./**/.env.staging)",
      "Read(./**/id_rsa)",
      "Read(./**/id_ed25519)",
      "Read(./**/*.pem)",
      "Read(./**/*.key)",
      "Read(./**/credentials.json)"
    ]
  }
}
